Pet Evolution System (Harvest Moon Style) - Analysis & Plan
💡 Analysis of Your Idea
"Excellent Idea! (10/10)" Integrating a Harvest Moon (Back to Nature) style system is a fantastic move for User Retention.

Emotional Attachment: Watching the cat grow creates a bond.
Daily Routine: "Once per day" logic encourages daily logins without requiring heavy grinding.
Performance: Very lightweight. The logic is simple arithmetic, and visuals (scaling) are GPU-accelerated. No lag impact.
🏗️ Technical Implementation Plan
1. Data Structure (Database)
We need to store the pet's state. I recommend adding a pet_stats JSONB column to the profiles table to keep it flexible.

// pet_stats structure
{
  "affection": 0,          // 0 - 255 points
  "last_pet_date": "2024-01-26", // To track daily "Pet" action
  "last_play_date": "2024-01-26", // To track daily "Yarn" action
  "last_feed_date": "2024-01-26"  // To track daily "Feeding"
}
2. The Logic (Harvest Moon Rules) 📜
We will replicate the mechanics you described:

Action	Points	Limit	Condition
Pet/Click Cat (click)	+2	Once/Day	Only 1st click counts
Play Yarn (yarn)	+2	Once/Day	Only 1st play counts
Feed (log_food)	+2	Once/Day	First meal logged
Neglect (Miss Login)	-1	Daily	If streak breaks (User doesn't open app)
Over-click (Annoy)	-2	Unlimited	If clicked > 5 times fast (Angry mode)
3. Growth Stages (Evolution) 🌱
User requested 3 stages based on Hearts (1 Heart = 25 Points). We will use CSS Scale for smooth performance (no need to load 3 separate large images, just scale the one user chose).

Stage 1: Kitten (Baby) 🍼
Condition: Hearts < 3 (< 75 pts)
Visual: Scale 60% (Small & Cute), Pitch higher meow?
Stage 2: Junior (Teen) 🧢
Condition: Hearts 3 - 6 (75 - 150 pts)
Visual: Scale 80%
Stage 3: Adult (Master) 👑
Condition: Hearts 6+ (> 150 pts)
Visual: Scale 100% (Full Size)
4. UI Elements
Heart Meter: Display 1-10 Hearts (❤️) somewhere (maybe hovering above cat on click, or in a "Pet Status" modal).
Visual Feedback: When gaining affection, show a +❤️ floating animation.
5. Performance Strategy (Zero Lag) ⚡
To ensure "Smoothness":

Optimistic UI: Update the UI instantly (Hearts go up, Cat grows).
Background Save: Send the data to Supabase silently in the background. Don't block the UI waiting for the server.
CSS Transforms: Use transform: scale() for growth. It’s GPU efficient.
